<% content_for :title, "Communities — A lighter way to gather" %>

<main class="landing-page">
  <section class="landing-hero" aria-labelledby="landing-title">
    <div class="landing-copy">
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">A solarpunk space</p>
      <h1 id="landing-title">Grow a greener, kinder way to live together.</h1>
      <p class="landing-lede">Communities is a calm home for people who want to live lightly on the planet. Share what you know, tend what you love, and learn to live well with less.</p>

      <div class="landing-actions">
        <%= link_to "Enter your community", login_path, class: "button" %>
        <%= link_to "Join the waitlist", waitlist_path, class: "button button-secondary" %>
        <a class="landing-text-link" href="#support">Donate <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="landing-text-link" href="#whats-inside">What’s inside <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>

      <p class="landing-note">Private circles of trusted people. Join by invitation and sign in with your wallet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit-ring orbit-ring-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit-ring orbit-ring-two"></div>
      <div class="orbit-core">
        <span class="orbit-mark">✦</span>
        <span class="orbit-label">Tend &amp; repair</span>
      </div>
      <span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot-one"></span>
      <span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot-two"></span>
      <span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot-three"></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-principles" aria-label="Principles of our commons">
    <article>
      <span class="principle-number">01</span>
      <h2>Live within Earth’s limits</h2>
      <p>Choose habits that help the planet and stand the test of time.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="principle-number">02</span>
      <h2>Repair, reuse, remember</h2>
      <p>Fix things, use them again, and pass on what you know so nothing good gets wasted.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span class="principle-number">03</span>
      <h2>Keep power local</h2>
      <p>Grow trust close to home. Your wallet membership means your place in a community is yours to keep.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section id="whats-inside" class="landing-features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
    <div class="landing-section-heading">
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">What’s inside</p>
      <h2 id="features-title">A home for shared learning.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-feature-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Private communities</h3>
        <p>Each group is a quiet, private space with its own members and topics — no noise, no audience to impress.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Threads &amp; rich posts</h3>
        <p>Write and share guides, notes, and project updates with people who will really use them.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Conversations that repair</h3>
        <p>Ask questions, offer fixes, and pass useful knowledge between neighbours.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Community-led moderation</h3>
        <p>Members look out for each other, and every group decides how to keep its own space welcoming.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="see-it-in-action" class="landing-screens" aria-labelledby="screens-title">
    <div class="landing-section-heading">
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">See it in action</p>
      <h2 id="screens-title">Made for the way you gather.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-screen-grid">
      <figure class="screen-card">
        <%= image_tag "screen-dashboard.png", alt: "The member dashboard, showing community stats, your communities and recent activity", loading: "lazy" %>
        <figcaption>
          <h3>Your workspace at a glance</h3>
          <p>Stats, communities and recent activity — everything you care about, in one quiet place.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="screen-card">
        <%= image_tag "screen-thread.png", alt: "A community thread with rich posts and formatting", loading: "lazy" %>
        <figcaption>
          <h3>Threads &amp; rich posts</h3>
          <p>Write and share guides, notes and project updates with the people who will really use them.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="screen-card">
        <%= image_tag "screen-post.png", alt: "A post with a threaded conversation of comments", loading: "lazy" %>
        <figcaption>
          <h3>Conversations that repair</h3>
          <p>Ask questions, offer fixes, and pass useful knowledge between neighbours.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="landing-how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div>
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">Getting started</p>
      <h2 id="how-title">A digital home for sustainable living.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="landing-steps">
      <li><span>01</span><p>Get invited by someone in a community.</p></li>
      <li><span>02</span><p>Sign in with your wallet.</p></li>
      <li><span>03</span><p>Bring your skills, your questions, and your good ideas.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-membership" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
    <div class="landing-section-heading">
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">Ownership</p>
      <h2 id="membership-title">Membership that travels with you.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-membership-grid">
      <p class="landing-membership-intro">No username to remember, no password to lose. Your place in every group is tied to the wallet you already have.</p>

      <ul class="landing-facts">
        <li>
          <h3>Invited, not scraped</h3>
          <p>Groups grow by invitation, so everyone arrives with a reason to be there and someone who vouches for them.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Portable identity</h3>
          <p>Sign in from any device — your memberships and reputation travel with you.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>No ad-funded attention</h3>
          <p>No ads, no algorithms designed to keep you scrolling. Just space to care for what matters to you.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="support" class="landing-donate" aria-labelledby="donate-title">
    <div class="landing-section-heading">
      <p class="landing-eyebrow">Stewardship</p>
      <h2 id="donate-title">Help keep the lights on.</h2>
      <p class="landing-donate-lede">Communities has no ads. If it’s useful to you, a small gift keeps it running.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-donate-grid">
      <a class="donate-card" href="https://buymeacoffee.com/ildar.safin" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="donate-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">☕</span>
        <h3>Buy me a coffee</h3>
        <p>The easiest way to say thanks — a warm cup for the person keeping this running.</p>
        <span class="donate-card-link">buymeacoffee.com/ildar.safin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>

      <article class="donate-card">
        <span class="donate-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">₿</span>
        <h3>Bitcoin</h3>
        <p>Send a little support straight to the project.</p>
        <code class="donate-address">bc1qscqzsw0rak5u4tftwj5s0xzsf800ljfa0e8vcw</code>
        <button type="button" class="donate-copy" data-controller="copy-button" data-copy-button-copy-text-value="bc1qscqzsw0rak5u4tftwj5s0xzsf800ljfa0e8vcw" data-action="click->copy-button#copy">Copy address</button>
      </article>

      <article class="donate-card">
        <span class="donate-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◆</span>
        <h3>Ethereum</h3>
        <p>Support on-chain, if that’s your thing.</p>
        <code class="donate-address">0x9F5C61b1FC5f95308b1fF2e3d382A6b71Fb22CAc</code>
        <button type="button" class="donate-copy" data-controller="copy-button" data-copy-button-copy-text-value="0x9F5C61b1FC5f95308b1fF2e3d382A6b71Fb22CAc" data-action="click->copy-button#copy">Copy address</button>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
